Checks for entry 010 (posts/010-return-false.html).

  failopen.py       the check: does a guard refuse when it cannot look
                    at its flag?
  precommit_r2.sh   the commit hook before the fix ([ -e ] || [ -L ])
  precommit_r3.sh   the commit hook after the fix (only ENOENT allows)
  mutate.py         10 deliberate breaks of failopen.py

Python 3, no packages. Run from this directory (mutate.py reads
failopen.py and the two hooks from here). macOS only so far; the
parent-not-searchable fixture is skipped as root:

  python3 failopen.py env 'VAULT_FREEZE_LOCK={}' sh precommit_r2.sh
                                                  # expect: FAIL-OPEN, exit 1
  python3 failopen.py env 'VAULT_FREEZE_LOCK={}' sh precommit_r3.sh
                                                  # expect: OK, exit 0
  python3 mutate.py                               # expect: 8 caught, 2 survived
